From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ps5sd <ps5sd@localhost>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] server: gallery with parameters, thumbnails, pages and search

Each image saved to --output-dir carries its parameters as sd.cpp's own
routes give them (a tEXt "parameters" chunk, A1111's text with sd.cpp's
JSON at the end); a video's go to .thumbs/<name>.txt. Each saved image and
video gets a thumbnail (.thumbs/<name>.jpg, 320 px), and older PNGs get
theirs on the first request. GET /ps5sd/v1/gallery takes offset, order,
q (a search in the prompts) and type, says the total in X-Total-Count and
gives each file's prompt; GET /ps5sd/v1/gallery/info/<file> gives what
made it.
---
